            "detailed_description": "Puzzle Wishes is a combination of a dating sim and an actively scrolling match 3. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlaying as an explorer looking for a place to settle down, you come across a magic lamp on your way to a kingdom. In it is a centuries-old genie who grants you a wish to find your soul mate. It turns out that you don't have a soul mate... you have seven! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures: <br />\r\n<br />\r\n• Seven girls to romance <br />\r\n• Talk to girls, increase elemental affinity (powers up puzzle pieces) and go on 'puzzle' dates with them <br />\r\n• Fantasy environment <br />\r\n• 49 stages to beat, 7 for each girl <br />\r\n• Partial voice acting for all heroines (by Caitlynn French, Kathy Pfautsch, Bindy Coda and Kaila Nicole) <br />\r\n• Swimsuit CG for each heroine!",
            "about_the_game": "Puzzle Wishes is a combination of a dating sim and an actively scrolling match 3. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlaying as an explorer looking for a place to settle down, you come across a magic lamp on your way to a kingdom. In it is a centuries-old genie who grants you a wish to find your soul mate. It turns out that you don't have a soul mate... you have seven! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures: <br />\r\n<br />\r\n• Seven girls to romance <br />\r\n• Talk to girls, increase elemental affinity (powers up puzzle pieces) and go on 'puzzle' dates with them <br />\r\n• Fantasy environment <br />\r\n• 49 stages to beat, 7 for each girl <br />\r\n• Partial voice acting for all heroines (by Caitlynn French, Kathy Pfautsch, Bindy Coda and Kaila Nicole) <br />\r\n• Swimsuit CG for each heroine!",
            "short_description": "Lucky you! You've found a genie who's going to help you find your 'soulmate'! Date seven cute girls by comboing and chaining puzzle pieces together in this dating sim. The puzzle mini-games actively scroll and will rely on your fast reflexes and thinking.",
