                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The good: The puzzle is fun, the backgrounds look good, and the main gameplay sprites are all well made.\n\nThe bad: The UI is bad. Simple buttons, needing to leave the main game to enter into a second game mode, the fact that most of the the puzzle sprites are just recolors.\nThere is only one puzzle that just gets harder. And unlike the game it is clearly trying to ape: HuniePop there's nothing the items of HP that shake up the gameplay, or the alt play mode that is thefinal test for each win.\n\nThe ugly: Some of the reward images are... well. As an artist myself I don't like to speak ill. But I would have never taken these to print on a game I'd charge more than a buck for. But even with the anatomy gaffs and stiff posing the reall problem for me is that they don't match the rest of the game's art. When I got my first one with the barmaid, it looked so off I actually wondered if the character sprites were ripped from a different game.",
